# direnv — `cd` into the repo and the devshell loads itself.
#
# Four of the six repositories this project learned its Nix conventions from ship one
# (crane, devshell, clan-infra, zero-to-nix); it is the standard way to make a devshell
# ambient rather than something you remember to type.
#
# Requires direnv, which is the developer's choice and NOT part of the flake: nothing
# here fails without it. `nix develop` does the same job by hand.
use flake
